p- Added a hint to the path in the cave sample area- Fixed the C4C video from continuing to play when ejected I'm running out of things to fix, send more if you find it! Thanks for playing, - Kyle Frost (Mahelyk)","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T20:29:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114034107","verified_at":"2026-10-22T22:20:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4881130-1846651706691047","game_id":"steam-4881130","kind":"update","title":"Hotfix 0.22.4","summary":"Hey Pioneers! Thanks to everyone who's played the demo, and everyone who has submitted any issues you've found! This change-list isn't massive, and that's good! There's not a ton to fix, and most of my efforts have been going to adding in the Localization system, which should be working relatively soon. Changes - Fixed some small holes in the map, for players who like to 100% clean the dirt- Added Window mode option to Video Settings. Borderless is now the default. This seems to fix quite a few ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T16:20:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691047","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:25:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4881130-1846651706679243","game_id":"steam-4881130","kind":"update","title":"Hotfix 0.22.3","summary":"Hey Pioneers! Some more small fixes and improvements today. I was able to find a bug that effects players using DX11 that prevented them from cleaning artifacts, that's the big one. There are also more options for performance for players on lower end systems! 0.22.3 changelist- Added a new song from our composer \"A View Quite Nice\"- Fixed the alert spam when backpack is full- Fixed a hardware issue with DX11 that caused artifacts to not be able to be cleaned- Added an OFF setting to Global Illum","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T20:45:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706679243","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:25:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4881130-1846651706675700","game_id":"steam-4881130","kind":"update","title":"Hotfix 0.21.1","summary":"Hey Pioneers! Some more fixes. The two big ones should be fixing the dirt crumbs that can respawn sometimes, and the rare issue where artifacts can't be cleaned. If you still have any issues like these (or any other issies) let me know! AA 0.21.1 changelist- Added a potential fix to occasional dirt patches that regrow when cleaning up the crumbs- Moved the blue wire to containment door so it stays in Layer 1 to avoid confusion- Updated the Jetpack quest to give a location hint- Improved large ro","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T21:56:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706675700","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:25:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4881130-1846651706672549","game_id":"steam-4881130","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 0.21.0","summary":"Hello Pioneers! (Cash 4 Cache does NOT sponsor this public announcement, they wouldn't pay for it)Firstly, thank you everyone for all the support and interest! Here are some bug fixes and QoL things from the last day!0.21.0 changelist- Fixed typo on Jetpack upgrade \"Life\" to \"Lift\"- Increased the cleaning power of the base tools for upgrade levels 1-5 to reduce the early grind on cleaning- Increased size of lower level TNT explosions- Decrease cost of TNT by half for all tiers- Fixed artifact st","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T22:15:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706672549","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:25:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4881130":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:54:26Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:54:26Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4881130":"2026-10-26T14:54:26Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4881130":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:54:26Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:54:26Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:54:26Z"},"5309920":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:54:26Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:54:26Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:54:26Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4881130","app_id":4881130,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:04Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"ca0e4d04be6a057a7bd65a4f4cf5bcb37f720b69a5934de037a56333e142cdc3","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"\"Alien Archeologist\"는 차분한 점진적 발굴 게임입니다. 다양하고 업그레이드 가능한 도구로 광석을 채굴하고, 땅을 폭파하고, 기묘한 유물을 정리하면서 행성의 중심에 숨겨진 비밀을 향해 더 깊이 나아가세요.","publishers":[{"name":"Black Lantern Collective","creator_clan_account_id":45680191},{"name":"Gamersky Games","creator_clan_account_id":42658688}],"developers":[{"name":"TheClassifiedX","creator_clan_account_id":45650514}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1796414400,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_full"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Alien Archeologist Full Game Teaser","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1792778737","trailer_category":1,"microtrailer":[{"filena